# `gcloud builds submit .` (MCP / BFF / Playground / dispatcher / puller images) uploads only the code the images need.
# data/ (case bank, docstore, Europe PMC cache) lives in the Cloud Storage bucket mounted at /data; secrets come from
# Secret Manager.
/*
!/claimdrift/
!/apps/
!/agents/
!/ingestion/
!/elastic/
!/.gcloudignore
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pyc
/claimdrift/tests/
/apps/bff/tests/
# dispatcher image: the service itself; its legacy scripts, tests and OAuth files stay local
/apps/dispatcher/scripts/
/apps/dispatcher/tests/
/apps/dispatcher/*.json
